            0.736,
            0.637
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "II Shift of AI research from academic to real-world"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.653,
            0.973,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": "**--- Enabled by qualitative change in the field, driven by “Deep Learning” / Big Data.**"
